    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 54 tablets of baclofen 20 mg with 28.1 days on hand at 1.9 tablets per day.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The label for NDC 71335249700 names Bryant Ranch Prepack as the plant (FEI 1000519407) with a VAI inspection on 2026-07-16.",
